// The last field of each row is max|fitted(default surface = "interpolate") - fitted(direct)| as measured in R:
// R's default kd-tree interpolation differs from the exact local fits by 0.03-0.28 on this noisy data, so callers
// comparing with R's defaults need a loose tolerance.
//
// smooth.spline: R uses a cubic B-spline basis with knots at all unique x for nx <= 49 (a knot subset above), and its
